      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Strong bunch of two-year-olds here, headed by INTEMPERANCE (6) who resumes after showing good ability in his maiden campaign. Last seen when placed in the Nutrien Final in May having earlier kicked off his career with an easy win at this circuit and distance. May have developed further with maturity and should be ready to go off a trial win. BOYSTROUS (9) is a lightly-raced but progressive colt who maintained an unbeaten record at this circuit and distance when getting home narrowly last start. Kept to to the mark with a trial since and draws for a trail. IM EL ARQUERO (7) draws wide but has to be respected after landing a Group 1 in the QBred Triad Final at Albion Park last start. Impressive debut winner STRAATHDALE (3) is up in grade but draws well and could take this next step. ATOMIK CRUNCH (8) draws out but should be ready to peak after placing in both starts off a spell, the latest a second in the Listed Tatlow Stakes at Menangle.",
